# Impeccable Document Rules

Documentation ensures design consistency and long-term quality.

---

## Core Principle

Do not rely on memory.

Document how and why decisions are made.

---

## Document Decisions

- Record:
  - design choices
  - UI patterns
  - reasoning behind decisions
- Ensure future consistency

---

## Define Patterns

- Standardize:
  - cards
  - buttons
  - layout
  - spacing
- Reuse patterns instead of reinventing

---

## Reusability

- Create reusable components
- Avoid duplicating logic or UI
- Keep system scalable

---

## Simplicity

- Keep documentation clear and readable
- Avoid unnecessary complexity

---

## Living System

- Update documentation when design changes
- Keep it relevant and current

---

## Alignment

- Ensure all contributors (human or AI) follow the same rules
- Use documentation as a shared reference

---

## Constraints

- Do not over-document
- Keep focus on practical usage
- Maintain clarity

---

## Goal

The system should feel:

- consistent
- maintainable
- scalable
- understandable
